  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercise_type\": \"CEFR English Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"The concept of 'home' is complex and multifaceted. It can be a physical place, a sense of belonging, or even an emotional state. For many people, home is where they feel safe and secure, but it can also be a source of comfort and stability in times of uncertainty.\n\nIn recent years, the notion of home has been redefined by globalisation and technological advancements. With the rise of remote work and digital communication, people are no longer tied to a specific location to maintain relationships or pursue their careers. This shift has led to new forms of community building and social interaction, but it also raises questions about the nature of belonging and identity.\n\nAs we navigate this changing landscape, it's essential to consider what home means to us as individuals and as a society. Is it a physical space, a virtual connection, or something more abstract? By exploring these questions, we can gain a deeper understanding of ourselves and our place in the world.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main idea of the passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The concept of home has changed significantly due to technological advancements.\", \"Home is only a physical space.\", \"Globalisation has led to the loss of traditional communities.\", \"The passage discusses the importance of family in modern society.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The concept of home has changed significantly due to technological advancements.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"According to the passage, what is one way that people are redefining their sense of home?\",\n      \"options\": [\"By moving to a new city.\", \"Through remote work and digital communication.\", \"By pursuing traditional careers.\", \"By abandoning modern technology.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"Through remote work and digital communication.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"The word 'multifaceted' in the passage means:\",\n      \"options\": [\"Having many sides or aspects.\", \"Being extremely complex.\", \"Relating to a specific location.\", \"Describing a physical object.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"Having many sides or aspects.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about the author's attitude towards the changing concept of home?\",\n      \"options\": [\"They are opposed to technological advancements.\", \"They believe that traditional communities are being lost.\", \"They think that people are becoming more isolated.\", \"They see this change as an opportunity for growth and exploration.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"They see this change as an opportunity for growth and exploration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"The author's purpose in writing the passage is:\",\n      \"options\": [\"To persuade readers to adopt a traditional lifestyle.\", \"To describe the effects of globalisation on communities.\", \"To encourage readers to explore new forms of community building.\", \"To criticise modern technology for its negative impact.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"To encourage readers to explore new forms of community building.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
